<title>USA: Big City Bagels lowers exercise prices.</title>
<headline>Big City Bagels lowers exercise prices.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big City Bagels Inc said on Thursday that effective July 11 it will reduce the exercise price of its class A and B redeemable common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>The company will reduce the exercise price on the class A warrants to $2.50 per share for a period of 60 days from the present $4.50 per share.  This special exercise period will last until September 8 or it may be extended for up to an additional 30 days at the company's discretion.</p>
</text>
